        "text_icTS5iVG8jHznugS": "<p>First, check your tracking information to see the current status of your delivery. If your order is delayed beyond the expected delivery window or shows as delivered but you haven&apos;t received it, contact us immediately at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"mailto:support@breathelio.com\">support@breathelio.com</a> with your order number. Our team will investigate with the shipping carrier and ensure you receive your order or arrange a replacement.</p>"
